# LumiBob Data Storage

## Primary Store — PostgreSQL / TimescaleDB

All run data, price history, and pair state are stored in a TimescaleDB database.
Since PR #44 (merged 2026-07-12), the **authoritative database lives on an EC2 instance** (SSH alias `lumibob-db`). The local postgres is empty — do not query it expecting run data.

To connect, open the SSH tunnel first, then query through it:

```bash
ssh -f -N -L 5433:localhost:5432 lumibob-db
```

Connection string: `postgresql://lumibob:lumibob@localhost:5433/lumibob` (set as env var `DB_URL`).
Schema is defined in `schema.sql`. Apply once via: `psql` with `DB_URL` set, e.g. `psql "postgresql://..." -f schema.sql`.

### `backtest_runs`
One row per backtest or paper trading run. Replaces `_settings.json`.

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `run_id` | VARCHAR(10) PK | 6-char Lumibot run ID |
| `mode` | VARCHAR(10) | `backtest` or `paper` |
| `started_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Strategy startup time |
| `completed_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Strategy finish time (`NULL` if crashed) |
| `settings` | JSONB | Full settings dict (see `backtest-evaluation` rule for typical keys; may include legacy `ticker_limit` on old runs) |

### `portfolio_snapshots`
One row per trading day per run. Replaces `_stats.csv` and `_indicators.csv`. TimescaleDB hypertable.

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `time` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Trading day timestamp |
| `run_id` | VARCHAR(10) | FK → `backtest_runs` |
| `portfolio_value` | NUMERIC | Total portfolio value |
| `cash` | NUMERIC | Uninvested cash |
| `spy_value` | NUMERIC | SPY normalised to starting portfolio value |
| `active_pairs` | INT | Number of pairs being monitored |
| `avg_correlation` | NUMERIC | Mean of **finite** long-horizon correlations (`corr_long` / `pairs.correlation`) across active pairs |
| `cash_ratio` | NUMERIC | `cash / portfolio_value` |
| `daily_buys` | INT | New pair entry buy orders submitted that day (excludes top-ups) |
| `daily_sells` | INT | Sell orders submitted that day |
| `daily_topups` | INT | Legacy column; strategy currently passes 0 (no top-up loop) |
| `pairs_scanned` | INT | Pair evaluations that cleared hard gates (e.g. penny, sector, cooldown) and were scored |
| `candidates_found` | INT | Candidate pairs scored (composite) that day |
| `candidates_buy_ready` | INT | New buy slots queued into the target portfolio that day |

### `trades`
One row per filled order. Replaces `_trade_events.csv`. All rows are fills — no status filtering needed.

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | SERIAL PK | Auto-increment |
| `run_id` | VARCHAR(10) | FK → `backtest_runs` |
| `pair_id` | INT | FK → `pairs` (nullable) |
| `symbol` | VARCHAR(20) | Ticker traded |
| `side` | VARCHAR(4) | `buy` or `sell` |
| `quantity` | NUMERIC | Shares filled |
| `price` | NUMERIC | Fill price |
| `slippage` | NUMERIC | Slippage incurred (default 0) |
| `filled_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Execution timestamp |

### `pairs`
Discovered lead/lag pairs. Replaces `pairs/pair_history.json` (that file is no longer used).

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | SERIAL PK | Auto-increment |
| `lead_symbol` | VARCHAR(20) | Lead ticker |
| `lag_symbol` | VARCHAR(20) | Lag ticker |
| `lag_days` | INT | Offset in days (default 1) |
| `short_ma` | INT | Short MA window (default 2) |
| `long_ma` | INT | Long MA window (default 5) |
| `correlation` | NUMERIC | Long-horizon Pearson correlation (`corr_long`); updated on save and on daily re-score |
| `simulated_return` | DOUBLE PRECISION | Legacy; often NULL for score-and-rank runs (no `PairSimulator` gate) |
| `initial_cost` | NUMERIC | Cost of the initial buy (quantity × price); legacy top-up fields may reference this |
| `discovered_at` | DATE | Date first discovered |
| `last_updated` | DATE | Date correlation was last recomputed |
| `active` | BOOLEAN | Whether pair is currently being monitored |

### `stock_prices`
OHLCV price cache. TimescaleDB hypertable, partitioned by `time`. 2-year rolling retention, compressed after 90 days.

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `time` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Trading day (UTC) |
| `symbol` | VARCHAR(20) | Ticker |
| `open/high/low` | NUMERIC | Optional OHLC fields |
| `close` | NUMERIC | Close price (required) |
| `volume` | BIGINT | Daily volume |

Price data is served by `StockDataCache` (read-through cache: DB first, Alpaca as fallback for gaps). Never call `yfinance` directly for price data.

### `tickers`
Tradeable universe. Refreshed nightly via `AlpacaClient.get_tradeable_assets()`.

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `symbol` | VARCHAR(20) PK | Ticker |
| `exchange` | VARCHAR(10) | NYSE, NASDAQ, etc. |
| `last_updated` | DATE | Date of last refresh |

